    <TD STYLE="text-align: center; width: 33%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: #191919">12 months&rsquo; notice</TD><TD STYLE="width: 1%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: #191919">&nbsp;</TD>
