    <TD STYLE="text-align: center; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: #191919">6 months&rsquo; notice</TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: #191919">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: #191919; text-align: left">$</TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: #191919; text-align: right">337,500</TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: #191919; text-align: left"><SUP>&nbsp;</SUP></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: #191919; text-align: left">Dr. Michael Cross</TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: #191919">&nbsp;</TD>
